(6411041, 950956, 67152, '<td valign="top">a cute little guy!  i tend to see more tans and such rather than golds but i am not going to mark you down for it</td>', 'a cute little guy!  i tend to see more tans and such rather than golds but i am not going to mark you down for it', '2011-05-11 16:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6411044, 950601, 94241, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely.<br/> <br/>The one thing I might suggest is consider a different crop.  It feels like it needs a smidgen more headroom in the sky, and maybe is a little constrained by the 2:3 aspect ratio.  Were it me I would have framed a little bit wider and cropped to a 16:9.  I think 16:9 works great for landscapes, as it feels a bit more cinematic.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I love a good landscape, and I think this is great.  The fine detail in the mud makes the image.</td>', 'Quite lovely. The one thing I might suggest is consider a different crop.  It feels like it needs a smidgen more headroom in the sky, and maybe is a little constrained by the 2:3 aspect ratio.  Were it me I would have framed a little bit wider and cropped to a 16:9.  I think 16:9 works great for landscapes, as it feels a bit more cinematic. Anyway, I love a good landscape, and I think this is great.  The fine detail in the mud makes the image.', '2011-05-11 16:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6411058, 950567, 94241, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and beautiful posing.  I love how her hair falls over the near shoulder to bury her in mystery.  But the over-exposed table lamp is killing it for me.  Usually you don''t want anything in a frame to be brighter than the main subject, or it pulls the attention away from the main subject.</td>', 'Great idea, and beautiful posing.  I love how her hair falls over the near shoulder to bury her in mystery.  But the over-exposed table lamp is killing it for me.  Usually you don''t want anything in a frame to be brighter than the main subject, or it pulls the attention away from the main subject.', '2011-05-11 17:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6411059, 949929, 94241, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  The focus point doesn''t seem deliberate though -- I''d kind of expect the egg yolk to be the focus point but there''s no real clear focus point anywhere.</td>', 'Cool idea.  The focus point doesn''t seem deliberate though -- I''d kind of expect the egg yolk to be the focus point but there''s no real clear focus point anywhere.', '2011-05-11 17:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6411104, 950862, 94241, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.<br/> <br/>I think the focus point needs to be on the tips though, not on the base of each plug.  Based on leading lines, the eye wants to follow each plug to the tip, but that fights against where the selective focus tries to direct the eye.  It''s a little disconcerting.</td>', 'Cool idea. I think the focus point needs to be on the tips though, not on the base of each plug.  Based on leading lines, the eye wants to follow each plug to the tip, but that fights against where the selective focus tries to direct the eye.  It''s a little disconcerting.', '2011-05-11 17:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6411109, 951002, 94241, '<td valign="top">Holy Frick that''s awesome.  The soft diffusion filter makes this shot.</td>', 'Holy Frick that''s awesome.  The soft diffusion filter makes this shot.', '2011-05-11 18:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6411112, 950684, 91783, '<td valign="top">i think it would have been better if the hand was out of the shot...</td>', 'i think it would have been better if the hand was out of the shot...', '2011-05-11 18:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6411113, 951002, 91783, '<td valign="top">i really like the editing that you did to this shot, but i think it needs a little something extra. Like a girl in a nice summer dress.</td>', 'i really like the editing that you did to this shot, but i think it needs a little something extra. Like a girl in a nice summer dress.', '2011-05-11 18:07:45.000000', NULL, 1);
