(6411806, 950746, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really love the composition and the feel of this image, but for me, it lacks vibrancy.  It appears kind of "washed out" and I believe that a slight adjustment in curves would have made a difference.  I know that there is a post-processing style that leans towards this slightly desat, retro look, but, with a very few exceptions, I am not a fan of that.  Just my opinion, of course.   (Also love that the flower pendant she is wearing kind of mimics the flowers in the field...that''s a nice touch.)</td>', 'I really love the composition and the feel of this image, but for me, it lacks vibrancy.  It appears kind of "washed out" and I believe that a slight adjustment in curves would have made a difference.  I know that there is a post-processing style that leans towards this slightly desat, retro look, but, with a very few exceptions, I am not a fan of that.  Just my opinion, of course.   (Also love that the flower pendant she is wearing kind of mimics the flowers in the field...that''s a nice touch.)', '2011-05-12 11:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
