(6412406, 951014, 129756, '<td valign="top">A little further away would''ve allowed you to capture the flag in it''s entirety in the reflection. Would''ve been awesome.</td>', 'A little further away would''ve allowed you to capture the flag in it''s entirety in the reflection. Would''ve been awesome.', '2011-05-13 02:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412409, 950102, 129756, '<td valign="top">absolutely love. however would''ve liked a little more sharpness overall especially close to the eyes...seems too soft a focus. still my fav tho :)</td>', 'absolutely love. however would''ve liked a little more sharpness overall especially close to the eyes...seems too soft a focus. still my fav tho :)', '2011-05-13 02:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412612, 950862, 50526, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I dont think U got the focus right. Rule of thirds would be great here, and the background''s details are too visible for me.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I dont think U got the focus right. Rule of thirds would be great here, and the background''s details are too visible for me.', '2011-05-13 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412615, 950666, 50526, '<td valign="top">It reminds me great cartoon "Cities of Gold" :)  love this shot.</td>', 'It reminds me great cartoon "Cities of Gold" :)  love this shot.', '2011-05-13 11:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412622, 950421, 50526, '<td valign="top">Man I would like to see this beautiful woman on a dark background..  but the sword against her left breast is great!</td>', 'Man I would like to see this beautiful woman on a dark background..  but the sword against her left breast is great!', '2011-05-13 11:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412626, 951002, 50526, '<td valign="top">Oh, so soft :)  like it very much. Grats!</td>', 'Oh, so soft :)  like it very much. Grats!', '2011-05-13 11:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412628, 950960, 50526, '<td valign="top">Its more like banner here :)</td>', 'Its more like banner here :)', '2011-05-13 11:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412640, 950695, 50526, '<td valign="top">More pink for me ;)</td>', 'More pink for me ;)', '2011-05-13 11:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412923, 950494, 61788, '<td valign="top">Real gold for sure. I like simplicty of composition, and lines both foreground and background elements created. Ladybug, from my point of view, becomes significant here perhaps because of the color. I feel one step simpler - withoug bug - composition can be better, but then it may become something others did already. Not sure :)</td>', 'Real gold for sure. I like simplicty of composition, and lines both foreground and background elements created. Ladybug, from my point of view, becomes significant here perhaps because of the color. I feel one step simpler - withoug bug - composition can be better, but then it may become something others did already. Not sure :)', '2011-05-13 15:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412924, 950810, 130147, '<td valign="top">Looks delicious. Wasn''t sure about the background though at first it almost made my eyes ache, but there is something about it I really like.</td>', 'Looks delicious. Wasn''t sure about the background though at first it almost made my eyes ache, but there is something about it I really like.', '2011-05-13 15:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412928, 950763, 61788, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and original composition. Very cool contrast of textures. Right side - I think is not the strongest case of negative space - little bit cropped will work better.</td>', 'Very interesting and original composition. Very cool contrast of textures. Right side - I think is not the strongest case of negative space - little bit cropped will work better.', '2011-05-13 16:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412934, 950774, 130147, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors. In my opinion one of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Awesome colors. In my opinion one of the best in this challenge.', '2011-05-13 16:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412938, 950909, 61788, '<td valign="top">Good idea (shows you understand the light :) and good execution. Simple composition, but not striking for some reason. Golden reflection attracts me more because of the combination of sharpness at the touch point and then painterly lines to the left. Don''t know what to do to dircet focus there more.</td>', 'Good idea (shows you understand the light :) and good execution. Simple composition, but not striking for some reason. Golden reflection attracts me more because of the combination of sharpness at the touch point and then painterly lines to the left. Don''t know what to do to dircet focus there more.', '2011-05-13 16:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412942, 950494, 130147, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one is awesome. Fits the challenge perfectly, as golden as it gets without jewelry.</td>', 'Wow, this one is awesome. Fits the challenge perfectly, as golden as it gets without jewelry.', '2011-05-13 16:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6412978, 950725, 61788, '<td valign="top">You found interesting subject. Cool to see reflections of the building on right side and the same upside down on left. Overall little bit bright. I suggest to think about cropping on left side up to external dark circle (where I think interesting part ends) to remove the bright part in left lower corner and also move center even more to left. Good work anyway.</td>', 'You found interesting subject. Cool to see reflections of the building on right side and the same upside down on left. Overall little bit bright. I suggest to think about cropping on left side up to external dark circle (where I think interesting part ends) to remove the bright part in left lower corner and also move center even more to left. Good work anyway.', '2011-05-13 17:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6413109, 950125, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful range of golds, and lovely soft focus. One of my favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful range of golds, and lovely soft focus. One of my favourites in this challenge.', '2011-05-13 21:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
